\title{
Quantum Entanglement of High Angular Momenta
}

\author{
Robert Fickler \({ }^{1,2, *}\), Radek Lapkiewicz \({ }^{1,2}\), William N. Plick \({ }^{1,2}\), Mario Krenn \({ }^{1,2}\), Christoph Schaeff \({ }^{1,2}\), Sven Ramelow \({ }^{1,2}\), Anton Zeilinger \({ }^{1,2,3, *}\) \\ \({ }^{1}\) Quantum Optics, Quantum Nanophysics, Quantum Information, University of Vienna, Boltzmanngasse 5, Vienna A-1090, Austria \\ \({ }^{2}\) Institute for Quantum Optics and Quantum Information, Austrian Academy of Science, Boltzmanngasse 3, Vienna A-1090, Austria \\ \({ }^{3}\) Vienna Center for Quantum Science and Technology, Faculty of Physics, University of Vienna, Boltzmanngasse 5, Vienna A-1090, Austria \\ *Correspondence to: robert.fickler@univie.ac.at or anton.zeilinger@univie.ac.at
